        "UPCs": [
          "850060195280"
        ],
        "Description": "The SUNSEEKER X3 Plus is a wireless robot lawn mower designed for residential lawns up to 0.3 acre, or approximately 13,000 sq. ft. RTK, vSLAM and Vision AI navigation support repeatable, systematic mowing without daily manual control, while AI obstacle avoidance helps the mower respond to common objects and changing yard conditions. X3 Plus handles slopes up to 17° (about 31% grade) and uses an 8 in. cutting system with 9 height settings from 1.6 to 3.2 in. A 20V 5Ah battery provides up to 168 minutes of runtime and recharges in about 1.5 hours. Through the SUNSEEKER app, homeowners can create multiple lawn zones, auto-map areas, set mowing schedules and select pattern-cutting plans for front yards, back yards and other separated spaces. Automatic recharging, rain, lift, tilt and collision sensors support autonomous operation, while edge cutting, headlights, theft protection, smart-home integration and voice control add convenience. Backed by a 2-year manufacturer warranty.",
        "ManufacturerPartNumbers": [
          "SKRMX3PLUS"
